WEBVTT

00:01:42.482 --> 00:01:46.748
Oooooh, this is delicious!

00:01:52.458 --> 00:01:54.756
Ouch! Ow! Ouch!

00:01:56.562 --> 00:01:58.831
Here, Miss Ayeka.

00:01:58.831 --> 00:02:01.234
Be careful. It's hot.

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:04.470
Oh, thank you very much.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.960
Ow!

00:02:13.212 --> 00:02:15.612
Are you all right, Miss Ayeka?

00:02:17.116 --> 00:02:18.551
Hey!

00:02:18.551 --> 00:02:21.487
What's the meaning of all this flirting?

00:02:21.487 --> 00:02:23.489
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:02:23.489 --> 00:02:26.592
It-It's just you thinking too much, Ryoko.

00:02:26.592 --> 00:02:29.026
Well, I hope so.

00:02:33.533 --> 00:02:39.062
Yes, it is. That's what it is, absolutely.

00:02:42.141 --> 00:02:43.631
My, it's delicious.

00:02:53.019 --> 00:02:56.556
Damn it! That Ayeka
seems to have gotten so close

00:02:56.556 --> 00:02:58.024
to my Tenchi somehow.

00:02:58.024 --> 00:03:01.050
You can't be too careful with her, really.

00:03:19.112 --> 00:03:22.343
Oh, I see. It's born, finally.

00:04:27.013 --> 00:04:29.482
I don't think I've ever
seen you around here before.

00:04:29.482 --> 00:04:32.474
Have you come to pay respect to the shrine?

00:04:35.088 --> 00:04:38.958
I, Sasami, have come to find my elder sister.

00:04:38.958 --> 00:04:41.828
So your name is Sasami?

00:04:41.828 --> 00:04:43.989
Cute name, isn't it?

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.599
Yeah!

00:04:59.412 --> 00:05:01.312
S-Sasami?

00:05:08.688 --> 00:05:09.950
Hmm?

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.191
What's wrong, Tenchi?

00:05:12.191 --> 00:05:14.060
You look like you've just seen a ghost.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.996
Have you been tricked
by a fox or something?

00:05:16.996 --> 00:05:19.932
Maybe I have.

00:05:19.932 --> 00:05:21.422
Huh?

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:27.840
Tenchi, the girl you saw,

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:32.145
she may not be a phantom
nor a raccoon in disguise.

00:05:32.145 --> 00:05:35.410
How do you know that just by
hearing the story from me, Grandpa?

00:05:37.717 --> 00:05:43.022
Yes. It's an easy guess for someone
like me who has had appropriate training.

00:05:43.022 --> 00:05:46.792
Wow, is that so?

00:05:46.792 --> 00:05:51.264
Hmm? Now I see her in my mind's eye.

00:05:51.264 --> 00:05:55.301
Oh, she has her hair tied on both sides.

00:05:55.301 --> 00:05:57.970
Wow, Grandpa! That's exactly what I saw.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:01.007
And she has some freckles on her cheeks.

00:06:01.007 --> 00:06:03.643
Yeah, that's right.
She did have some freckles.

00:06:03.643 --> 00:06:04.544
Tenchi!

00:06:04.544 --> 00:06:07.380
She'll show up here very soon!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.974
What?! Really?!

00:06:11.417 --> 00:06:15.087
So you like to cook
and are good at it, Sasami?

00:06:15.087 --> 00:06:17.954
Yeah. I cook all the time.

00:06:18.991 --> 00:06:20.526
Just as I told you.

00:06:20.526 --> 00:06:22.762
Oh, I know you.

00:06:22.762 --> 00:06:24.764
You know each other?

00:06:24.764 --> 00:06:27.665
Hey, you've grown to be quick, Tenchi.

00:06:28.367 --> 00:06:31.704
How come Sasami is here?

00:06:31.704 --> 00:06:34.640
Sasami is the little sister of Ayeka,

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:38.477
and she's come to take Ayeka home.

00:06:38.477 --> 00:06:41.935
Oh, so Ayeka's your sister.

00:06:45.384 --> 00:06:47.045
Sasami?

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.783
Dear sister!

00:06:52.425 --> 00:06:55.986
Sasami, how did you get here all by yourself?

00:06:59.065 --> 00:07:02.523
So this is the end of my holiday.

00:07:07.607 --> 00:07:10.371
Cheers!

00:07:12.144 --> 00:07:15.580
"Good-bye, Ayeka and Mihoshi."

00:07:15.648 --> 00:07:18.751
Oh, you can't imagine how happy I am!

00:07:18.751 --> 00:07:21.053
Now I can finally go home!

00:07:21.053 --> 00:07:23.256
I'm happy for you, Mihoshi.

00:07:23.256 --> 00:07:26.225
Now, go ahead, have some drinks,
and eat as much as you want.

00:07:26.225 --> 00:07:31.430
You and Ayeka are our
guests of honor tonight.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.232
Thank you so very much.

00:07:33.232 --> 00:07:35.063
Oh, don't mention it.

00:07:37.036 --> 00:07:39.027
Miss Ayeka...

00:07:45.044 --> 00:07:48.447
Hey, Ryoko, is that all you can eat?

00:07:48.447 --> 00:07:51.780
Yes. I don't have much
appetite tonight, somehow.

00:07:52.885 --> 00:07:56.922
You must have eaten
too much sweet potatoes.

00:07:56.922 --> 00:08:00.726
But I have the craving for sour things.

00:08:00.726 --> 00:08:02.962
Sour things?

00:08:02.962 --> 00:08:06.796
Ryoko, could it mean
that you are pregnant?

00:08:10.236 --> 00:08:13.406
Well, it looks like your
tummy has grown bigger, too.

00:08:13.406 --> 00:08:15.041
Then that must be it!

00:08:15.041 --> 00:08:17.777
You know what causes pregnancy, don't you?

00:08:17.777 --> 00:08:18.744
Well, yes.

00:08:18.744 --> 00:08:22.339
Wow! I can't wait to see the baby!

00:08:36.162 --> 00:08:38.164
The baby is born.

00:08:38.164 --> 00:08:40.860
The baby from Tenchi and me.

00:08:46.172 --> 00:08:48.407
Well done, Tenchi!

00:08:48.407 --> 00:08:50.276
I've always thought you
were rather slow to mature,

00:08:50.276 --> 00:08:53.579
but now I'm so happy to see
you've grown into a healthy man.

00:08:53.579 --> 00:08:55.448
I'm so proud of you, Tenchi.

00:08:55.448 --> 00:08:57.149
Congratulations, Tenchi.

00:08:57.149 --> 00:08:59.310
I'm happy for you.

00:09:00.486 --> 00:09:01.987
It's a misunderstanding!

00:09:01.987 --> 00:09:04.990
Ryoko, why do you have to
tell such a trumped-up story?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:08.728
Ooh, you don't have to be so embarrassed...

00:09:08.728 --> 00:09:11.764
Tenchi... Papa.

00:09:11.764 --> 00:09:14.834
Then, I'm a great-grandfather now.

00:09:14.834 --> 00:09:18.065
Ooh, my first grandchild, darling.

00:09:19.638 --> 00:09:20.639
Miss Ryoko!

00:09:20.639 --> 00:09:25.201
You can't prove that egg is yours, can you?

00:09:26.345 --> 00:09:30.716
H-How cruel of you to say such a
thing about the egg I labored for.

00:09:30.716 --> 00:09:35.488
She's right. It's cruel to say
such a thing. Oh, poor Ryoko.

00:09:35.488 --> 00:09:37.957
Ayeka is trying to pick a quarrel with us

00:09:37.957 --> 00:09:41.394
just to chill out the
happy feeling we all share.

00:09:41.394 --> 00:09:43.996
Don't you see you're annoying Lord Tenchi?

00:09:43.996 --> 00:09:46.265
You just don't understand how men are.

00:09:46.265 --> 00:09:48.434
He is pleased, happy inside.

00:09:48.434 --> 00:09:50.469
I'm not!

00:09:50.469 --> 00:09:55.007
I will not be convinced unless I see proof!

00:09:55.007 --> 00:09:58.544
Tenchi and I made love,
and this egg here is born.

00:09:58.544 --> 00:10:00.978
It's as simple as that, if you want proof.

00:10:01.881 --> 00:10:04.076
Made love?

00:10:10.222 --> 00:10:13.092
We'll see what kind of
egg it is if we break it.

00:10:13.092 --> 00:10:16.362
Oh, no, you fool, stop it!

00:10:16.362 --> 00:10:19.263
Stop it, please, Ayeka!

00:10:33.179 --> 00:10:37.138
The egg... The egg is smashed.

00:10:38.717 --> 00:10:41.447
M-My first grandchild.

00:11:14.353 --> 00:11:18.057
My dear, our first grandchild is born.

00:11:18.057 --> 00:11:21.927
Well, she's not the typical
kind you normally would expect,

00:11:21.927 --> 00:11:24.864
but she's healthy and energetic
looking, just like Tenchi...

00:11:24.864 --> 00:11:26.765
What of that thing looks
like me, I'd like to know?!

00:11:26.765 --> 00:11:28.934
Here, see? You look exactly like each other.

00:11:28.934 --> 00:11:30.469
Sasami.

00:11:30.469 --> 00:11:32.171
My, you are right.

00:11:32.171 --> 00:11:35.508
Tenchi, you make sure you raise her well.

00:11:35.508 --> 00:11:36.998
Dad...

00:11:39.945 --> 00:11:42.106
Are you hungry?

00:11:44.116 --> 00:11:45.777
Would you like this?

00:11:58.631 --> 00:12:00.566
She needs a name, doesn't she?

00:12:00.566 --> 00:12:05.936
I know! What about Tenko,
being a child of Tenchi and Ryoko?

00:12:07.873 --> 00:12:10.809
It's not my child!

00:12:10.809 --> 00:12:12.378
Oh, sorry. That's right.

00:12:12.378 --> 00:12:15.414
Well, then, what shall we name her?

00:12:15.414 --> 00:12:18.284
Ryo-Ohki.

00:12:18.284 --> 00:12:21.086
Oh, good morning, Ryoko.

00:12:21.086 --> 00:12:24.356
Her name is Ryo-Ohki.

00:12:24.356 --> 00:12:26.058
Ryo-Ohki.

00:12:26.058 --> 00:12:31.621
Oh, I remember, that's the
name of your spaceship, Ryoko.

00:12:35.701 --> 00:12:38.170
Oh, I'm impressed you remember that.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:40.138
That means...

00:12:42.741 --> 00:12:46.643
You must really like
the name Ryo-Ohki, Ryoko.

00:13:20.112 --> 00:13:21.547
Wow!

00:13:21.547 --> 00:13:24.883
So this is your spaceship, Sasami?

00:13:24.883 --> 00:13:28.988
Well, I guess it's time to
say good-bye. I'll miss you.

00:13:28.988 --> 00:13:31.357
I'll be glad to escort you
out halfway, if you want.

00:13:31.357 --> 00:13:34.493
Hmmph! Without a ship?

00:13:34.493 --> 00:13:37.529
You needn't worry.

00:13:37.529 --> 00:13:39.326
Ryo-Ohki!

00:13:46.038 --> 00:13:47.072
Don't you cry!

00:13:47.072 --> 00:13:49.973
I'll let you eat as much as you want later.

00:13:51.944 --> 00:13:53.879
So it's just as I suspected.

00:13:53.879 --> 00:13:57.950
She is a child of Ryo-Ohki,
isn't she? The new Ryo-Ohki.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:00.043
What do you mean, Miss Ayeka?

00:14:01.387 --> 00:14:03.582
I'll show you!

00:14:23.442 --> 00:14:26.445
So Ryo-Ohki is a spaceship?

00:14:26.445 --> 00:14:28.781
Well, let's get going now!

00:14:28.781 --> 00:14:30.883
Not with you, I assure you.

00:14:30.883 --> 00:14:33.218
Oh, it would be such a help.

00:14:33.218 --> 00:14:36.855
I hear things are not as quiet
as before around here nowadays.

00:14:36.855 --> 00:14:40.426
Yippee! Ryo-Ohki is coming with us halfway.

00:14:40.426 --> 00:14:43.793
Sasami! Miss Mihoshi! We are leaving.

00:14:45.364 --> 00:14:46.999
Wait for me, Ayeka.

00:14:46.999 --> 00:14:51.003
Please don't leave me behind!

00:14:51.003 --> 00:14:56.308
I'm counting on you to beat up the
space pirate when you see one, okay?

00:14:56.308 --> 00:15:00.646
Has she completely forgotten
that I am the space pirate?

00:15:00.646 --> 00:15:03.274
I guess so.

00:15:13.525 --> 00:15:17.552
Be good!

00:15:25.604 --> 00:15:30.405
Well, we can't see
Tenchi's place anymore.

00:15:47.392 --> 00:15:49.795
L-I could have.

00:15:49.795 --> 00:15:51.697
Did you say something, Ayeka?

00:15:51.697 --> 00:15:53.866
Oh, uh, no, nothing.

00:15:53.866 --> 00:15:57.636
I bet you were remembering
Tenchi, weren't you?

00:15:57.636 --> 00:15:58.971
Well, I...

00:15:58.971 --> 00:16:00.305
You're blushing, Ayeka!

00:16:00.305 --> 00:16:03.642
So, you were in love with Tenchi?

00:16:03.642 --> 00:16:05.077
What are you talking about, Sasami?

00:16:05.077 --> 00:16:08.313
What, really, you were, Miss Ayeka?!

00:16:08.313 --> 00:16:10.649
M-Mihoshi, you, too?

00:16:10.649 --> 00:16:14.380
Otherwise, how come you have
things like this in your luggage?

00:16:16.822 --> 00:16:19.024
L-It's just a souvenir picture.

00:16:19.024 --> 00:16:20.392
Ooh, come, come now.

00:16:20.392 --> 00:16:21.794
You don't have to be so shy about it.

00:16:21.794 --> 00:16:23.362
Why don't you make up your mind and say it?

00:16:23.362 --> 00:16:26.498
You should now. Go on, say it!

00:16:26.498 --> 00:16:29.160
Oh, you're impossible.

00:16:34.773 --> 00:16:40.579
Don't stare at me like that, please. L-I just...

00:16:40.579 --> 00:16:42.147
Excuse me.

00:16:42.147 --> 00:16:45.310
- Oh, no! Lord Tenchi!
- Excuse me.

00:16:46.752 --> 00:16:49.188
Have I done anything wrong?

00:16:49.188 --> 00:16:52.291
Oh, Lord Tenchi!

00:16:52.291 --> 00:16:58.363
Ayeka, you have tons of
suitors back home, don't you?

00:16:58.363 --> 00:17:02.857
Just leave Tenchi to me, then, and... Huh?

00:17:04.303 --> 00:17:05.793
Lord Tenchi.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:14.913
I am Ayeka, the first
princess of the Jurai royal family.

00:17:14.913 --> 00:17:19.145
I have a duty of supporting the
Jurai royal family, to lead it to prosper.

00:17:20.686 --> 00:17:22.654
I understand.

00:17:22.654 --> 00:17:26.758
I just can't stay on Earth forever.

00:17:26.758 --> 00:17:28.961
I know.

00:17:28.961 --> 00:17:33.031
I enjoyed every minute I spent on Earth.

00:17:33.031 --> 00:17:36.935
I close my eyes, and I can
remember all those things,

00:17:36.935 --> 00:17:39.338
the beautiful autumn
leaves I watched with you,

00:17:39.338 --> 00:17:43.175
the delicious sweet potato you gave me.

00:17:43.175 --> 00:17:44.743
Miss Ayeka...

00:17:44.743 --> 00:17:48.380
Hey, don't you think
you've talked enough, you two?

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.416
I will never forget you, Lord Tenchi.

00:17:51.416 --> 00:17:53.485
Nor will I.

00:17:53.485 --> 00:17:55.621
Lord Tenchi.

00:17:55.621 --> 00:17:59.785
I... The feelings I have for you...

00:18:02.561 --> 00:18:05.297
No, nothing.

00:18:05.297 --> 00:18:07.900
That's enough, Tenchi.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.869
Miss Ayeka, please take care of yourself,

00:18:10.869 --> 00:18:13.038
and stay well when you go back home.

00:18:13.038 --> 00:18:16.108
L-I thank you very much.

00:18:16.108 --> 00:18:18.577
Farewell, Lord Tenchi.

00:18:18.577 --> 00:18:21.671
Be good forever and ever.

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:27.675
L-I did the right thing.

00:18:30.555 --> 00:18:35.424
We proceed to prepare
the final acceleration now.

00:18:37.996 --> 00:18:39.164
Preparation completed.

00:18:39.164 --> 00:18:41.724
Your instruction, please, Princess Ayeka.

00:18:42.501 --> 00:18:44.803
Depart for Planet Jurai.

00:18:44.803 --> 00:18:46.464
Yes, Ma'am.

00:18:50.208 --> 00:18:53.178
Oh, what's that carrot for?

00:18:53.178 --> 00:18:58.817
That's the carrot Ryo-Ohki
was eating a few minutes ago.

00:18:58.817 --> 00:19:03.811
Well, now we can go
home, sweet home, Tenchi.

00:19:11.997 --> 00:19:12.998
What's this?

00:19:12.998 --> 00:19:15.023
What is going on?

00:19:23.575 --> 00:19:25.711
What? Red alert!

00:19:25.711 --> 00:19:27.474
What is the matter?

00:19:30.382 --> 00:19:33.652
Ryo-Ohki is rapidly approaching this ship!

00:19:33.652 --> 00:19:35.787
Get out of the way, Ayeka!

00:19:35.787 --> 00:19:37.277
What?

00:19:59.111 --> 00:20:01.579
Why does it have to be this way?

00:20:06.752 --> 00:20:07.619
Wow, it's delicious.

00:20:07.619 --> 00:20:09.621
Really, I'm so glad I'm still alive.

00:20:09.621 --> 00:20:12.958
Now we'll be grounded
here on Earth for quite a while.

00:20:12.958 --> 00:20:16.728
If only Sasami hadn't
found that carrot up there.

00:20:16.728 --> 00:20:18.797
Here, Miss Ayeka.

00:20:18.797 --> 00:20:21.466
Be careful. It's hot.

00:20:21.466 --> 00:20:24.636
Oh, thank you very much.

00:20:24.636 --> 00:20:28.607
Hey, hey, hey, hey! You, Ayeka, there!

00:20:28.607 --> 00:20:30.108
What do you think you're doing?

00:20:30.108 --> 00:20:34.112
Hmmph. Nothing, as
you can see clearly, Ryoko.

00:20:34.112 --> 00:20:35.714
Nothing, huh?

00:20:35.714 --> 00:20:38.116
It's none of your business anyway.

00:20:38.116 --> 00:20:40.175
Here, Tenchi.

00:20:44.923 --> 00:20:46.491
I'll have the next one.

00:20:46.491 --> 00:20:48.220
Okay, okay.

00:20:50.962 --> 00:20:54.955
- Sasami.
- Sasami.

00:22:57.556 --> 00:23:00.859
The monster sealed in the cave
underneath the Masaki Shrine...

00:23:00.859 --> 00:23:04.296
it's been said, brings bad luck.

00:23:04.296 --> 00:23:06.298
Hey, Ryoko, aren't you listening?

00:23:06.298 --> 00:23:08.466
Sorry! I broke the seal.

00:23:08.466 --> 00:23:11.536
- What?!
- How is it looking?

00:23:11.536 --> 00:23:13.705
Wow! This is...

00:23:13.705 --> 00:23:15.740
Next episode is: "No Need for Monsters!"

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:18.310
The baddest trouble in
the universe resurrected!

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:21.143
It's unquestionably scary!
